{"prefectureId":"13","cities":{"13101":[{"id":"13101:national:f6bfc648fbcd","cityId":"13101","category":"文化・名所","text":"「江戸城跡のヒカリゴケ生育地」は国指定の天然記念物です。","source":"https://kunishitei.bunka.go.jp/heritage/detail/401/726"},{"id":"13101:national:c4afa9b4e033","cityId":"13101","category":"地域","text":"千代田区は、東京都の区部中央部に位置する特別区です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%8D%83%E4%BB%A3%E7%94%B0%E5%8C%BA&oldid=111209642"},{"id":"13101:national:648f24b2154f","cityId":"13101","category":"地域","text":"区内の永田町、霞が関といった地名は国会議員や官僚の代名詞です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%8D%83%E4%BB%A3%E7%94%B0%E5%8C%BA&oldid=111209642"}],"13102":[{"id":"13102:national:e96ca4f90a92","cityId":"13102","category":"地理・自然","text":"中央区は第二次世界大戦終戦直後まで運河と水運の町でした。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E4%B8%AD%E5%A4%AE%E5%8C%BA+%28%E6%9D%B1%E4%BA%AC%E9%83%BD%29&oldid=110647936"},{"id":"13102:national:9469c8cc6e35","cityId":"13102","category":"地理・自然","text":"区の北端との区界は竜閑川跡、西端は外堀跡および日本橋川、南端は汐留川跡です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E4%B8%AD%E5%A4%AE%E5%8C%BA+%28%E6%9D%B1%E4%BA%AC%E9%83%BD%29&oldid=110647936"}],"13103":[{"id":"13103:national:06c26ee1ee1a","cityId":"13103","category":"文化・名所","text":"「浅野長矩墓および赤穂義士墓」は国指定の史跡です。","source":"https://kunishitei.bunka.go.jp/heritage/detail/401/679"},{"id":"13103:national:3b4c91b6bb99","cityId":"13103","category":"地理・自然","text":"港区は、海岸埋立地から武蔵野台地にかけて入り組んだ高低差の大きい地形です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%B8%AF%E5%8C%BA+%28%E6%9D%B1%E4%BA%AC%E9%83%BD%29&oldid=111236514"},{"id":"13103:national:b5f8a071a702","cityId":"13103","category":"地域","text":"港区は、東京都の区部南部に位置する特別区です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%B8%AF%E5%8C%BA+%28%E6%9D%B1%E4%BA%AC%E9%83%BD%29&oldid=111236514"},{"id":"13103:national:173fcda12283","cityId":"13103","category":"地域","text":"港区の他の地域とは、レインボーブリッジやゆりかもめで結ばれているが飛地です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%B8%AF%E5%8C%BA+%28%